      },
      {
       "blocks": [
        {
         "c": [
          {
           "c": [
            "DOMC questions"
           ],
           "t": "b"
          },
          ": cover the options with a sheet of paper. Reveal ",
          {
           "c": [
            "one"
           ],
           "t": "i"
          },
          " option at a time, write YES or NO for it, and only then reveal the next one. You may not go back. This is how the real exam shows them: one option at a time."
         ],
         "t": "p"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "blocks": [
        {
         "c": [
